    "backstory": "Growing up on Yay Blvd, Nix learned to hustle before he could waddle. He scavenged parts from the Cryo-Preservation Plant wreckage, turning them into tools and a chilling defense against the Subchain City heat. Now, he stalks the fringes, a lone wolf with a score to settle against the Drip-hoarding overlords.",
